invariant: INV-19
file: bench/stack.py
catches: test/lint-stack-walk.sh
reason: the walk compiles x509_ca.c, which the default build does not
  package, beside the sources make lists. When the walk compiled every
  root source, its report for the default build listed
  ch_pubkey_from_pem_tcp_blocking at 576 bytes, a call that object does
  not export, and its TRUST=raw-ecdsa walk read p384.c's point_add() and
  rsa_mont.c's mont_mul() under p256_ecdsa_verify().

--- old
    return lines[0].split(), lines[1].split()
--- new
    return lines[0].split() + ["x509_ca.c"], lines[1].split()
